{
  "pack": {
    "_comment": [
      "Combined resource + data pack manifest for a NeoOrigins UI theme.",
      "",
      "pack_format values for 1.21.1:",
      "  - 34  resource pack",
      "  - 48  data pack",
      "",
      "The 'supported_formats' arrays below let one zip serve as both a",
      "resource pack and a data pack without Minecraft complaining about a",
      "version mismatch. Drop this whole 'theme-template' folder (renamed",
      "to your pack's name) into a .zip with pack.mcmeta at the root, then",
      "place the zip in:",
      "",
      "  - .minecraft/resourcepacks/   (so the textures/font/theme JSON load)",
      "  - <world>/datapacks/          (so the active_theme.json applies)",
      "",
      "Or, even simpler: ship the theme as a NeoForge mod jar and the",
      "originpacks/ folder will pick it up automatically on both sides."
    ],
    "description": "NeoOrigins UI theme",
    "pack_format": 34,
    "supported_formats": [34, 48]
  }
}
